<title>UK: ATHLETICS-EDWARDS OUT OF LAUSANNE AND OSLO MEETINGS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EDWARDS OUT OF LAUSANNE AND OSLO MEETINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>World triple jump record holder Jonathan Edwards has been forced to pull out of two grand prix meetings this week because of a heel injury.</p>
<p>Edwards will miss the grand prix in Lausanne on Wednesday and Oslo's Bislett Games on Friday.</p>
<p>Edwards said on Monday he had aggravated a problem he first encountered with the heel at the recent European Cup when he competed at a grand prix meeting in Sheffield on Sunday.</p>
</text>
